        src\components\ui\table-column-config\GridColumnDetailsPanel.tsx must not hand-wire `useGridColumnVisibility` — LedgerGridSurface resolves visibility from the FULL `columns` you pass it and hands the resolved list back through renderColumnHeader / renderRow / renderGroup.
