      error: |-
        src\design-system\components\grid\GridColumnDetailsTrigger.tsx must not hand-wire `railImport` — GridColumnGutter mounts the rail — a second mount is a second door onto `detail:grid-column-details`, which is the fork that already had to be undone once when chrome Fields and the header lip both opened it. A view has no reason to import the module at all.
